      en: "Mausoleum of Agostinho Neto is a remarkable feature of the geography and culture of Angola. This futuristic monument in Luanda is the final resting place of Angola's first president, Agostinho Neto. Its obelisk-like structure towers over the capital's coastline. Resting place of 1st president. Futuristic architecture. Luanda landmark. This landmark is part of the cultural heritage of Angola. Like many notable places in Angola, it combines regional character with wider significance. Thus, this place contributes to the diverse profile of Angola."
    },
